{"id":"00344","root":"uni00344_1","name":{"ja":"ブリュンヒルド","en":"Brunhilde"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ブリュンヒルド","en":"Brunhilde"},"aliases":["Brunhild"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni"],"release":"2020-06-15","limited":false,"characterId":223,"profile":{"ja":"魔界に住まう希少な高位鬼族。鬼神乙女（ワルキューレ）と呼ばれる女だけの鬼族で、全身を甲冑で覆ったような異形の姿をしており、衣類の類は纏わない。個人主義的で自らの欲望のまま好き勝手に生きるのが特徴の鬼族の中において、ワルキューレたちはかなり異質な存在。個人主義的であるが秩序を重んじ、彼女たちが“天帝”と敬う神の意思によって行動する。他の鬼族の女同様、ワルキューレたちは自分より強いと認めた男性戦士と子を成すのだが、個々があまりに強い力を有しているため、生殖を行なう事なく戦死するものが多い事から鬼神乙女と謂われる様になった。またワルキューレたちは他の鬼族には見られない特殊な力を持つ者が多い。ブリュンヒルドの能力“Ｅｎｇａｇｅｍｅｎｔ　ｏｆ　ｄｉａｍｏｎｄ”は自分の体の一部を“固定化”する事が出来る。“固定化”とはエネルギー変化をゼロにする事を意味し、つまり彼女が固定化した部位は絶対に破壊できない。ただし固定化できる範囲には限りがあり、全身を固定化する事はできない。","en":"Brunhilde is a rare high-rank demon residing in the Demon Realm. She belongs to the all-female demon race known as the Valkyrie, whose members appear as grotesque beings entirely clad in armor and wear no clothing. While the Valkyrie are fiercely individualistic, they also revere order and act according to the will of the deity they call \"the Heavenly Emperor.\" Like other demon women, Valkyrie mate only with male warriors they deem stronger, but their overwhelming power often leads to death in battle before reproduction, earning them the title \"demon goddesses.\" Many Valkyrie possess unique abilities unseen among other demons. Brunhilde's skill, \"Engagement of Diamond,\" allows her to \"fix\" parts of her body, rendering those areas indestructible by nullifying any energy change. However, the fixation range is limited; she cannot fix her entire body."},"illustrator":"おぶい","voiceActor":"中野志乃","forms":[{"id":"uni00344_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1188,2376],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[197,394],"def":[117,234],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":42,"skills":["1","630004"]},{"id":"uni00344_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1776,3552],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[319,638]